sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student
    participant P as Course player
    participant LC as LearningController
    participant LS as LearningService
    participant AM as AnswerMatcher
    participant DB as MySQL
    S->>P: types an answer, clicks Check
    P->>LC: POST /api/v1/learning/exercises/{id}/attempts
    LC->>LS: submitAnswer(id, answer, user)
    LS->>DB: load exercise and its course (published?)
    LS->>AM: matches(expected, given)
    AM-->>LS: ignores case, accents and spaces, tries each alternative
    alt correct and not completed yet
        LS->>DB: INSERT exercise_completion
    end
    LS->>DB: count completed exercises of the course
    LS-->>P: correct + course progress
    P->>P: feedback, progress bar, unlock next chapter
